  "_comment": "Self-contained fixture suite for the verifier (Phase 0). These are TEST DOUBLES committed under fixtures/ — NOT real Chrome Web Store extensions — so the suite runs fully offline with no dataset/SSH/LLM. Two are genuinely vulnerable (must verify), two are benign controls (must NOT verify). Run with: python run_benchmark.py --fixtures  (requires a working CHROME_BINARY_PATH — Chrome-for-Testing ~126 on kuria, or a Playwright-bundled Chromium locally).",
